  "content": {
    "rendered": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Holidays are supposed to be joyful, but when you’re quietly considering <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/colorado/divorce/\">divorce</a>, the season can feel heavy, overwhelming, and emotionally chaotic. Many Coloradans wait until the new year to file, but stress doesn’t disappear just because you’re waiting.</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understand the Holiday Stress Cycle</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The holidays magnify tension because of money, travel demands, disrupted routines, and clashing expectations.</span></p>\n<ol>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Set Healthy Boundaries. </span>Limit events. Avoid triggering topics. Protect your emotional bandwidth.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"2\">\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Don’t Start Divorce Conversations at Gatherings. </span>Holiday settings create emotional explosions. Save serious discussions for calmer days.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"3\">\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Prioritize Emotional Well-Being. </span>Take breaks, limit alcohol, talk to someone you trust, and protect your peace.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"4\">\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Keep Routines Consistent for the Kids. </span>Stability is everything. Courts prioritize this under C.R.S. §14-10-124.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"5\">\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Be Smart With Holiday Spending. </span>Track spending, avoid major purchases, don’t open new joint credit. Holiday debt becomes marital debt.</li>\n</ol>\n<ol start=\"7\">\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Quietly Consult a Colorado Divorce Attorney. </span>This does not mean you’re filing — it simply gives you clarity.</li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Give Yourself Permission to Wait. </span>January often brings clarity and breathing room.</li>\n</ol>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You Don’t Have to Decide Today</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Focus on getting through the holidays with stability.</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The Drake Law Firm Can Help</span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">We help individuals evaluate their options with clarity. <a href=\"https://thedrakelawfirm.com/contact-us/\">Schedule a consultation</a>.</span></p>\n"
  },
